y, WI</div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Meeting Ref</span><br><code style=\"font-size:.75rem\">MIN-2012-01-9491</code></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><span style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;padding:.2rem .5rem;background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #86efac\">&#10003; QUORUM ESTABLISHED</span><span style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">7 of 9 members present</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Attendance</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Title</th><th>Role</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Present</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Akanni Hernandez</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Director of Enterprise Architecture</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Intern</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Zach Khalil</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Facilities Manager</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Chief Information Officer</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Mere Weiss</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Vice President of Risk Management</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Spiritual Advisor</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Kyle Berger</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Senior Manager of Data Analytics</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">R&amp;D Advisor (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Onur Munoz</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Associate, Strategy &amp; Planning</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Committee Member</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Glen Nichols</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Payroll Specialist</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Senior Director</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Phuong Polat</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Executive Assistant to the CLO</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">M&amp;A Advisor (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Agenda</h5><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 1</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Regional Business Review: EMEA</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee reviewed the Regional Business Review: EMEA, a proposal to enter the 14 market. The discussion focused on the competitive landscape and the regulatory hurdles. The committee approved a budget for a feasibility study.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 2</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Change-in-Control Severance Plan Review</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The Change-in-Control Severance Plan Review was presented by Kyle Berger. After a short clarifying discussion, the committee members agreed that the matter was straightforward and did not require extensive debate. The motion to approve was passed without dissent.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for profitability:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Regulatory Response Committee approves the selection of Cheshire Consulting as the vendor for the Change-in-Control Severance Plan Review and authorizes management to execute the final contract.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Akanni Hernandez &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Onur Munoz</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 7 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 3</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Earnings Release and Guidance Review</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee reviewed the Earnings Release and Guidance Review and the associated analysis in Exhibit C. The discussion focused on the risk-reward trade-off. A motion to approve the expenditure was made, contingent on a final review by the legal department.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 4</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Ethics and Compliance Program Annual Report</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">Zach Khalil summarized findings from the Ethics and Compliance Program Annual Report review, covering the period ending 2012-01-09. The committee noted 17 employees affected across 14 locations in the SALT Advisory Services sector. A motion was introduced following discussion. See motion record below. Exhibit D contains the full supporting analysis.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 5</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Pay Equity Audit Findings and Remediation Plan</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee considered the Pay Equity Audit Findings and Remediation Plan, a proposal to adopt a new policy on trade secrets. The policy was approved and will be implemented company-wide.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for release:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Regulatory Response Committee approves the formation of a new subsidiary, Cheshire Consulting, to pursue the Pay Equity Audit Findings and Remediation Plan.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Mere Weiss &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Akanni Hernandez</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 5 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 2 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Action Items</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:2rem\">#</th><th>Description</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">1</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Prepare a summary of recent developments in corporate governance best practices</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Jacqueline Srisai</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2012-03-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">2</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Develop a plan for improving the employee onboarding experience</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Mortimer Wells</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2012-03-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">3</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Reconcile payroll records for affected employees and confirm accuracy with HR</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Huong Stephens</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2012-02-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">4</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Prepare a summary of the company&#x27;s intellectual property portfolio</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Theresa Tsegay</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2012-02-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">5</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Review the company&#x27;s insurance coverage for D&amp;O and cyber liability</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Abigail Mccarthy</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2012-02-28</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:#333;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:.5rem\">There being no further business, a motion to adjourn was made and carried unanimously. Meeting adjourned at 5:00 PM CT.</p><p style=\"font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem;color:#555\"><strong>Next meeting:</strong> 2012-02-10</p><div><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#888;margin-bottom:.25rem\">Respectfully submitted,</p><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.1rem\">Phuong Polat</p><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#666;margin-bottom:.75rem\">Executive Assistant to the CLO, M&amp;A Advisor (External)</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:2rem\"><div><div style=\"width:160px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Signature</div></div><div><div style=\"width:120px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Approved: ___________</div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><a href=\"/archive/2012/01/08/enterprise-risk-committee-report-8943/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\">&larr; Previous</a><a href=\"/archive/2012/01/0